{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Order/StructId.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Order.getStructId?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Order</span>.<span class=\"name\">getStructId?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the order structure id for `type`, if it is at least a preorder.\nThe classification is done and cached by `Sym.Arith.classifyOrder?` for the whole run;\nthis function only applies the `order` configuration flag.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Order/StructId.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Order.getStructId?","kind":"def","line":13,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Order.getStructId?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Order/StructId.lean#L13-L20"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.Classify","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Order.Types"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Order.StructId"}